# Template defaults (Next.js + Supabase)

- Default production stack for NK-generated apps.
- Auth: Supabase magic link / OAuth via `/login` and `/auth/callback`; middleware refreshes session.
- Data: `src/lib/services/` only — no raw Supabase in page components.
- AI: AI SDK UI (`useChat`); validate `OPENAI_API_KEY` before streaming.
- Migrations: apply `supabase/migrations/` on a fresh project; `profiles` uses RLS.
- Do not add experimental RSC generative UI unless explicitly requested.
